window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Weapons are not born, they're made. And a weapon, I have become.</b></p> <p>I am the scythe that will cleave the Gods' traitorous heads from their not-so-Divine bodies.</p> <p>Forced to the dangerous Ortus Island and the very first Mortal Gods Academy, I know that time is running out for both me and the Darkhavens.</p> <p>If we can't figure out what the Gods are planning and how to stop them, it's no longer just our lives on the line. It's the lives of every Mortal God in existence.</p> <p>In the world of the Gods, there is only one truth.</p> <p>Trust no one. Not even your blood.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
